    <item>
      <title>BOFA股票交易员张贴了创纪录的收入季度</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2025-04-15/bofa-stock-traders-post-a-record-quarter-of-revenue-video</link>
      <description><![CDATA[随着股票交易商发布创纪录的季度，美国银行银行从股票交易的收入上涨了17％，达到21.8亿美元。 Sonali Basak报道了彭博电视台。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2025-04-15/bofa-stock-traders-post-a-record-quarter-of-revenue-video</guid>
      <pubDate>Tue, 15 Apr 2025 11:08:03 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>美国铜行业寻求出口限制而不是进口关税</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-15/us-copper-industry-seeks-export-curbs-instead-of-import-tariffs</link>
      <description><![CDATA[美国铜业行业的主要参与者呼吁唐纳德·特朗普总统限制矿石和废金属的出口，而不是对进口征收关税，以促进国内生产。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-15/us-copper-industry-seeks-export-curbs-instead-of-import-tariffs</guid>
      <pubDate>Tue, 15 Apr 2025 11:03:50 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>爱马仕（Hermès）从LVMH夺取宝座，由自动关税缓刑提升的股票|开业交易04/15</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2025-04-15/hermes-takes-throne-from-lvmh-the-opening-trade-04-15-video</link>
      <description><![CDATA[爱马仕的市值超过了竞争对手LVMH的企业集团，该集团曾经试图在15年前震惊法国企业世界的隐身突袭中购买令人垂涎的Birkin包的制造商。当美国总统唐纳德·特朗普（Donald Trump）暂停汽车关税时，股票上涨，在暂停某些消费电子产品的税款后，对市场提供了进一步的缓解。

当欧洲各地的市场开放时，开业贸易拥有您需要了解的一切。通过分析，您找不到其他任何地方，我们分解了当今最大的故事，并与游戏中有皮肤的顶级客人交谈。由Anna Edwards，Guy Johnson和Kriti Gupta主持。  （来源：彭博）]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2025-04-15/hermes-takes-throne-from-lvmh-the-opening-trade-04-15-video</guid>
      <pubDate>Tue, 15 Apr 2025 10:38:38 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>印度的通货膨胀率保持在印度储备银行的目标之下，提高率降低了赌注</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-15/india-s-inflation-stays-below-rbi-s-goal-boosting-rate-cut-bets</link>
      <description><![CDATA[印度的通货膨胀率在三月份缓解，停留在中央银行的目标之下，并增加了进一步缓解亚洲第三大经济体增长的机会。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-15/india-s-inflation-stays-below-rbi-s-goal-boosting-rate-cut-bets</guid>
      <pubDate>Tue, 15 Apr 2025 10:32:05 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>由于美国贸易混乱损失</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-15/german-investor-outlook-plunges-as-us-trade-chaos-takes-toll</link>
      <description><![CDATA[由于美国总统唐纳德·特朗普（Donald Trump）的即时贸易措施有可能扼杀新生的恢复，投资者对德国经济的信心暴跌。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-15/german-investor-outlook-plunges-as-us-trade-chaos-takes-toll</guid>
      <pubDate>Tue, 15 Apr 2025 09:05:34 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>印度是第一个从4月2日关税开始消除损失的主要市场</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-15/indian-stocks-erase-losses-sparked-by-trump-s-april-2-tariffs</link>
      <description><![CDATA[在一个漫长的周末之后，印度股票恢复了交易，基准股票指数消除了本月早些时候美国总统唐纳德·特朗普（Donald Trump）互惠关税触发的所有损失。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-15/indian-stocks-erase-losses-sparked-by-trump-s-april-2-tariffs</guid>
      <pubDate>Tue, 15 Apr 2025 06:08:16 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Stellantis投资者对前首席执行官的2310万欧元生气</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-15/stellantis-draws-investors-ire-after-ex-ceo-tavares-received-23-1-million-pay</link>
      <description><![CDATA[Stellantis NV投资者正在反对汽车制造商的薪酬实践，该实践授予了前首席执行官Carlos Tavares€2310万欧元（2620万美元）的销售和收入下降。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-15/stellantis-draws-investors-ire-after-ex-ceo-tavares-received-23-1-million-pay</guid>
      <pubDate>Tue, 15 Apr 2025 04:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>国库会下降，钥匙量表的风险达到十年</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-15/treasury-term-premium-jumps-to-decade-high-on-policy-uncertainty</link>
      <description><![CDATA[国债下降了，而投资者则推动了他们要求的薪酬，以将更长的债券持有到十多年来，这是因为美国关税政策的后果使市场的后果超过了市场。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-15/treasury-term-premium-jumps-to-decade-high-on-policy-uncertainty</guid>
      <pubDate>Tue, 15 Apr 2025 03:03:17 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>S＆amp; P 500期货随着贸易战的轻松而稳定：市场包裹</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-14/stock-market-today-dow-s-p-live-updates</link>
      <description><![CDATA[在为期两天的进步之后，美国股票期货波动，因为交易者专注于特朗普政府可能增加关税的迹象，以减轻贸易战争的经济动荡。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-14/stock-market-today-dow-s-p-live-updates</guid>
      <pubDate>Mon, 14 Apr 2025 22:56:52 GMT</pubDate>
